{"id":"doloroso","lemma":"doloroso","pos":"adj","rank":2740,"glosses":["painful"],"ipa":"/doloˈɾoso/","forms":{"feminine":"dolorosa","masculinePlural":"dolorosos","femininePlural":"dolorosas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-doloroso.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Esto será doloroso?","en":"Will this be painful?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454043","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Es demasiado doloroso.","en":"It's too painful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442730","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"too much"},null]},{"text":"Esto es muy doloroso.","en":"This is very painful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454434","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null]},{"text":"La verdad puede ser más dolorosa que la mentira.","en":"The truth can be more painful than a lie.","words":[null,null,{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"more"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"lie, trick, falsity"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"honestly, to be honest"]]},{"text":"Fue lo más doloroso de mi vida.","en":"It was the most painful thing in my life.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692926","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"more"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,7,"my dear"]]}]}